        "kind": "parser_text",
        "text": "Take 24 of a peck of Flavor 10 p. of Currants, 3 pints of Ale Yeast, 3 pints of Cream, 16 Eggs, 4 p. of Butter, a pint of Sack, 4 grains of musk, 1 ounce of Mace & Cinnamon, a p. of Sugar, let your flour & plumbs be well dry, & mix all y! things together except the Plumbs, Let it Lie half an hour before a good fire to rise & when y! Oven is ready put in y! Plumbs an hour & half will bake it.",
